UIDED_DINING_SEATING_TYPE"],"可選擇哪些類型的座位？",null,[[[["E:DINING_SEATING_TYPE_INDOOR_DINING_AREA"],"室內用餐區",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwj605GwwdKWAxX5fPUHHdECNqgQ3YcHCHwoAA"]]],null,"座位類型",null,"0ahUKEwj605GwwdKWAxX5fPUHHdECNqgQ3IcHCHsoCg",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["整體的體驗遠超預期，是一次非常完美的用餐經歷。是使用自助機器點餐，店內的 用餐氣氛很好，空間設計充滿了日式職人的簡潔與溫馨感，燈光配置得宜，讓人一進門就能感受到舒適且放鬆的氛圍，非常適合在結束忙碌工作後，獨自或是與好友來這裡享用一碗熱騰騰的職人拉麵。\n\n餐點部分最讓我印象深刻的是拉麵裡的靈魂——肉質。這裡的角煮處理得極其 軟嫩，幾乎達到了入口即化的程度，肉質吸滿了湯頭的精華，咬下去的每一口都能感受到鮮甜的油脂與紮實的肉感平衡得恰到好處，完全沒有腥味或乾柴感。更令人驚豔的是一般拉麵店較少見的細節，這裡的 炒豆芽菜非常香！師傅顯然下了不少功夫在火侯的控制上，豆芽帶有濃郁的「鍋氣」，香氣噴鼻且保持著極致的清脆口感，與濃郁的湯頭搭配在一起，不僅解膩更增加了味覺的層次感，真的是畫龍點睛。\n\n從湯頭的厚實度、麵條的彈牙感，到最後令人回味無窮的軟嫩肉質與焦香豆芽，每一處細節都展現出店家對料理的堅持。這絕對是一間會讓人想一訪再訪的拉麵名店，無論是環境還是食物水準都無可挑剔。如果你也是拉麵愛好者，特別在意肉質口感與配菜香氣的朋友，這間店絕對是口袋名單的首選，大力推薦！",null,[0,125]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12710694276992505568/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFqTUZOVVkzaFdhbFpQV2xNeFRscHVWblZUV0U0elRGVXhTMVV3UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12710694276992505568/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFqTUZOVVkzaFdhbFpQV2xNeFRscHVWblZUV0U0elRGVXhTMVV3UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12710694276992505568/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFqTUZOVVkzaFdhbFpQV2xNeFRscHVWblZUV0U0elRGVXhTMVV3UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12710694276992505568/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFqTUZOVVkzaFdhbFpQV2xNeFRscHVWblZUV0U0elRGVXhTMVV3UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12710694276992505568/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFqTUZOVVkzaFdhbFpQV2xNeFRscHVWblZUV0U0elRGVXhTMVV3UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12710694276992505568/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFqTUZOVVkzaFdhbFpQV2xNeFRscHVWblZUV0U0elRGVXhTMVV3UlJBQhAA"]],[null